msgid "PaperMono"
msgstr "PaperMono"

#: ../../source/hardware/lora.rst:24 7502ccbddda64166824320f55e69523d
msgid ""
"On supported controllers, ``LoRa`` automatically selects the board-"
"specific SPI bus and the default CS, BUSY, and IRQ pins. PaperMono also "
"enables the built-in LoRa module automatically during initialization. The"
" CS, BUSY, and IRQ pins can still be overridden with constructor "
"arguments when required."
msgstr ""
"在支持的控制器上，``LoRa`` 会自动选择对应板卡的 SPI 总线以及默认的 CS、BUSY 和 "
"IRQ 引脚。PaperMono 还会在初始化期间自动启用内置 LoRa 模块。需要时，仍可通过构造参数"
"覆盖 CS、BUSY 和 IRQ 引脚。"

